WEBVTT

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.010
You gave everything back to me.

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.140
So I'm going to risk my life...

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.560
to get you back.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.100
Here I go!

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.830
Seven Senses of the Re'Union

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:55.950
The Lion and the Dragon Unite

00:02:01.410 --> 00:02:03.370
The elementals got locked out?

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:06.960
What should I do?
I used too much power.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.170
I only have enough to summon one more...

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:10.330
Satsuki!

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:15.510
Are you okay, Satsuki?

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:19.010
Sorry. I got carried away and summoned too many...

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:21.970
Don't worry! Can you still summon more?

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:23.970
Just one more time.

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:25.390
I see.

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:29.600
Mist Shift?

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:30.900
Be careful!

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:35.900
Damn! Is there anything else we can do?

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:39.660
What am I going to do?
Someone help me!

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:42.280
Haruto, duck and swing your sword to the left!

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:47.910
Takanori, analyze the floor and monster material!

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:51.750
Clive, throw three knives!

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:56.170
Nozomi, summon two Slimes!

00:03:00.340 --> 00:03:01.930
Satsuki! The fire elemental!

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:09.600
Haruto, strengthen the flames!
Takanori, make it brighter!

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:10.940
-Okay!
-Okay!

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:23.950
-Haruto, now!
-Okay!

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:25.580
Asahi...

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.580
We did it!

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.210
Asahi...

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.840
How did you...?

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.510
I sort of saw a vision.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:42.840
I figured out it was what was going to happen.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:47.350
You mean you saw the future?
Is that the Empath Sense?

00:03:47.720 --> 00:03:48.850
Who knows.

00:03:49.020 --> 00:03:51.100
What a mysterious power.

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:54.100
Yeah, it was weird. It's amazing, isn't it?

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:57.360
-That was really amazing!
-What is this? What's going on?

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.190
We did it, Satsuki.

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:01.740
Satsuki?

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:07.240
No one ever praised me when I got stronger.

00:04:07.410 --> 00:04:09.240
Magic is just...

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:11.500
Magic is!

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:18.880
Asahi?

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.390
Satsuki.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:27.430
That's not true.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.890
We're all grateful to you.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:34.270
You read my heart with the Empath Sense!
That's horrible!

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:36.980
No...

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:41.650
I can understand why you feel like crying.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:47.910
It's not fair.
You always keeping Haruto to yourself.

00:04:49.330 --> 00:04:56.040
So you finally said what you really think.
I've always been envious of you too.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:01.630
You fight at the front next to Haruto
and defeat lots of monsters.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:06.050
I felt sad every time Haruto said "Satsuki's amazing!"

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.050
It hurt so much I couldn't sleep.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:15.480
That's why I always wanted
to have the power to help Haruto too.

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:19.310
I bet that's why I'm able to use this power.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:23.320
If we told Haruto, we'd be putting him in
a difficult position.

00:05:23.940 --> 00:05:27.450
Let's work hard together,
until we can tell him someday.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:30.950
We're still in the same place.

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:36.210
Thanks, Asahi.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.420
You're always helping everyone out.

00:05:39.590 --> 00:05:41.590
That's why we're able to play together.

00:05:42.340 --> 00:05:44.550
Yeah. Yeah...

00:05:56.770 --> 00:05:59.190
I knew you'd come.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:02.730
So? What are you doing here?

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:05.320
I can't make my move now.

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:07.950
The two guilds have united,

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:10.240
and their forces have more than doubled.

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:14.080
In order to win, we need to make some preparations.

00:06:14.580 --> 00:06:16.910
-You're so calm.
-Not at all!

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:20.080
We cannot fail when we go rescue Asahi!

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:22.920
Everything must go according to plan!

00:06:23.550 --> 00:06:25.380
Haruto went alone.

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:39.940
That's all the better for us.
It'll save us time if he just dies.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:44.480
So you want to have Asahi all to yourself
after Haruto disappears from this world?

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:48.450
Exactly.
I thought I sent you a message.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:51.120
Your beautiful message went straight to my heart.

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:55.450
Like getting stabbed in the heart with a knife.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:59.460
But, I've already made up my mind.

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:14.850
You want to help Haruto?

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:16.310
And Asahi too.

00:07:16.470 --> 00:07:19.350
Why? If Haruto leaves Re'Union,

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:22.600
nothing's going to stand
between you and him!

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:26.730
Asahi doesn't exist in the real world anymore.

00:07:27.230 --> 00:07:30.070
-You don't understand anything.
-What?

00:07:30.530 --> 00:07:34.200
Asahi is a member of Subaru, and she's my friend.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:37.040
I've known her longer than Haruto or you.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:39.830
But that won't make your dream come true.

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:44.790
If I won like that, I'd just feel empty.
It'd just be running away.

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:50.380
My dream is to have Asahi with me,

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:53.140
and Haruto by my side.

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:55.930
That's pretty greedy of you.

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:07.980
If the person I like likes me back because
there's no one else left, that's pointless.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:12.200
You can't win against someone
who doesn't exist anymore.

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:16.990
So you're going to accept Asahi's existence just to win?

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:21.250
Yeah. I don't care what you say.
I won't budge on this.

00:08:22.660 --> 00:08:25.750
If you won't come with me,
we have nothing else to talk about.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:31.010
I will go alone so I can make sure
Haruto won't be erased from this world.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:35.680
I'm going to make trouble for you.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.530
Just give up!

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:59.660
Divine just wants to use Asahi Kuga's power
to bring peace to the world!

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:01.540
I don't believe you!

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:05.670
I'm going to protect her smile.
I made a promise.

00:09:10.380 --> 00:09:11.920
My Fighting Sense...

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:13.970
Dragon Bind.

00:09:14.130 --> 00:09:18.680
It was originally a collaboration Sense
for sealing away giant dragons.

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.810
This time, you're finished, Coeur de Lion!

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:27.690
Asahi...

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:30.820
Finish him.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:39.160
-Magic Sense light?
-Divinity Sense resistance destruction!

00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:42.370
A fusion of magic and divinity?

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:50.460
Takanori? Satsuki...

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:52.920
You came...

00:09:53.090 --> 00:09:56.340
I came to save Asahi.
I didn't come for you.

00:09:56.680 --> 00:10:00.640
Come on. You're always acting so cold.

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:03.100
How many are left?

00:10:03.430 --> 00:10:05.640
About 1500.

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:11.150
I'll believe you. You've never been wrong
about sensing others' presence.

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:14.990
Their number is the problem, not their level.

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:17.490
What? Are you scared?

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:20.870
You can't provoke me that easily.

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:23.740
-Let's go!
-Alterf!

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:25.330
Flooding Wave!

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:32.000
I can't believe you guys were fighting.
You're in lock step.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.300
Haruto, you're too slow!

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:44.770
-It's hard to match your timing! Do it right!
-I know!

00:10:46.220 --> 00:10:48.350
-Leonidas!
-Ash Break!

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:55.900
-Let's go, Takanori.
-Don't tell me what to do.

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:03.370
EMBODIMENT OF NATURE
PERFECT COLORS

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:05.910
CLIVE BEVERLY

00:11:10.870 --> 00:11:14.420
The enemy this time is
much more advanced than those before.

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:16.920
-This is bad.
-What's wrong?

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:20.680
-The walls have jewels for locking out elementals.
-What?

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:23.260
It's not completely impossible,

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:25.310
but I can't do any strong attacks.

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:29.560
So you guys teamed up too?

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:32.230
Letos! Where's Asahi?

00:11:32.400 --> 00:11:33.690
Right here!

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.150
Asahi!

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.440
Wonderful.

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:41.030
So this is her true power.

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:44.570
Take your dirty hands off Asahi right now!

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:49.830
-No way!
-Tie up Takanori!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.830
Everyone, do my bidding.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:53.210
Rain Function!

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:00.470
-Takanori?
-Stay back!

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:04.930
They know what we're going to do next.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:06.890
Angelus is an empath.

00:12:07.060 --> 00:12:08.560
He read Takanori's mind.

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:10.890
He's a world-class divine champion.

00:12:11.060 --> 00:12:12.730
He'd never let him do that.

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:16.230
No way. He's not reading his mind. He's reading...

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:18.860
The future?
Is it the Prophet Art?

00:12:19.030 --> 00:12:20.610
What?

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:24.280
Molecular decomposition.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:25.660
Breaker!

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:27.830
That's useless.

00:12:27.990 --> 00:12:31.960
Our guild made that using our finest skill.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:37.670
Even a world-class divine champion
can't decompose or analyze it.

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:42.380
And one more thing. That attack just now,
it's as Coeur de Lion said.

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:47.390
That's impossible! The Prophet Art
is an original Sense that only Asahi has!

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:48.930
You're right.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:51.640
This is the power of the Prophet Art.

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:55.310
Are you controlling Asahi's consciousness

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:58.400
and forcing her to use the Prophet Art?

00:12:58.730 --> 00:12:59.730
Yes.

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:03.030
I'm just looking at what her heart shows.

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:06.160
You're spying on Asahi's heart?

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:12.040
Spying? That sounds so undignified.
I'm just seeing into her heart.

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.580
They're both the same thing, you bastard!

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.920
You still don't understand.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:20.710
We prepared a restraint to nullify the Divinity Sense,

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:23.550
and placed jewels to lock out elementals.

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:26.300
The Prophet Art is mine.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:29.470
Everything here is for bringing an end

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:32.850
-to the legend of Subaru.
-You bastard.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:36.350
Well, let's go ahead and obliterate the legend.

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:38.270
Don't mess around with us!

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:42.690
Alterf!

00:13:45.650 --> 00:13:49.870
It's easy to dodge things
when you know they're coming.

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:54.870
Haruto's Fighting Sense is getting weaker.

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:57.120
Can't we do anything?

00:13:57.370 --> 00:13:58.880
Are we really that weak?

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.130
Asahi!

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.880
Wake up! Wake up, Asahi!

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:11.390
Calling out to her is useless.
She's been brainwashed. You can't lift it.

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:13.520
I said wake up!

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:14.980
It's no use.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:18.270
As long as I'm controlling her, she won't wake up.

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:22.520
Re'Union doesn't need legends that distort the world.

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:30.620
-Satsuki!
-Satsuki!

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:34.540
Am I going to lose again?

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:36.620
That's why...

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:40.330
I always wanted to have the power to help Haruto too.

00:14:40.500 --> 00:14:43.550
I bet that's why I'm able to use this power.

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:48.930
And now that same power is being used to hurt Haruto.

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:52.300
No way. It's unforgivable!

00:14:53.050 --> 00:14:56.810
I've always been envious of you too.

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:59.100
I felt the same way too.

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:03.060
Haruto is worried about you
and risking his life to save you.

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:06.070
You're always helping everyone out.

00:15:06.230 --> 00:15:08.190
That's why we're able to play together.

00:15:09.490 --> 00:15:10.610
That's right.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:14.280
That's right.
I made a promise. I'm...

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:15.830
not going to lose anymore!

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.080
I'm not going to let you play the captured princess!

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:22.080
You're my rival!

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:36.720
Come forth.

00:15:36.890 --> 00:15:41.980
Cross time and space to heed my sacred call!

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:44.270
Elemental Kings!

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:53.990
It has been six years, Kings.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:02.250
Those are the strongest in Union from back then...

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:07.000
Give us your orders, my Queen.

00:16:07.340 --> 00:16:10.510
Give your compatriots special powers.

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.470
At your pleasure.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:20.850
-What's that?
-That's against the rules!

00:16:21.180 --> 00:16:22.890
Didn't you know?

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:26.860
The Senses are the perfect example of
something unfair and against the rules.

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:30.110
-Angelus!
-I know!

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:32.360
I'm a challenger.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:34.860
I'm going to smash through the Prophet Art!

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.660
Phalanx!

00:16:49.460 --> 00:16:51.880
Destroy them! Reichsapfel!

00:17:10.320 --> 00:17:11.860
What just happened?

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:20.660
I'll never forgive you!
You deserve to die!

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:23.460
What are we going to do, Angelus?

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:25.460
We'll use our last resort.

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:28.420
Why didn't you use it earlier?

00:17:28.710 --> 00:17:33.380
It's something that can only be used
in times like this.

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:41.970
-Angelus, you bastard.
-What?

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:46.060
How does it feel? It's the fear of 3000 people!

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:47.730
It's quite terrifying, right?

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:50.650
Empath Sense, Tyrant.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:54.740
It's the fear, anger, and resentment
of all the players you defeated in the past.

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:58.740
I've gathered those negative emotions
and given them form!

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.670
We've been in tight spots lots of times before.

00:18:13.840 --> 00:18:17.260
But we've always been able to get through them.

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:19.890
Please...

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:21.510
Give us strength...

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:23.010
Asahi...

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:25.770
We have to do something else

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:27.020
about the future...

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:28.770
I bet the three of you can!

00:18:29.310 --> 00:18:30.560
Asahi...

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:35.150
Recall.

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:38.950
The Senses you've built up yourselves...

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:45.120
-Just now...
-In my head...

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.290
Six years ago...

00:18:48.580 --> 00:18:51.420
This isn't the time to think!
It's the same as back then!

00:18:51.710 --> 00:18:54.920
Yeah! Let's go, Satsuki! Takanori!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:57.970
Go, Haruto! We're opening the door to the world!

00:18:58.130 --> 00:19:00.800
Solitude Zero!

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:15.110
I'm stronger than I was back then.

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:18.490
Bend space! Rage, wind! Fermion!

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:37.130
Estrella...

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:46.140
What?

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:49.270
Estrella.

00:19:49.430 --> 00:19:51.480
While Satsuki's magic bends space

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:54.310
and Takanori's Divinity Sense controls time,

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:56.730
I cut through hundreds of dimensions.

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:59.740
It's one of Subaru's special moves.

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:02.320
Sylvestre!

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:06.490
-Asahi!
-Thank you, Satsuki!

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:10.250
I'm not going to let you have my Prophet Art!

00:20:15.380 --> 00:20:17.800
How dare you mess with my Asahi!

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:19.510
Wait! Listen to me!

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:21.510
We're not going to wait for you.

00:20:24.220 --> 00:20:26.430
My Re'Union!

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:29.350
My ideal world!

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:31.730
Go wallow in regret in the real world.

00:20:38.150 --> 00:20:40.030
Do you really need it?

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:41.400
Yeah.

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:43.030
If that's what you say.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:45.030
It'll be okay.

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:47.830
I won't pass out this time.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:53.330
The numbers are below expectations.

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:56.040
The experiment failed.

00:20:56.210 --> 00:20:58.090
Based on the condition of the subject,

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:02.090
it's still too early to test
the true ability to see the future.

00:21:05.090 --> 00:21:06.090
What was that!?

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.720
We don't know either.

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:12.020
Sorry, Takanori.

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:15.650
You held onto Subaru's ring.

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:19.440
Takanori, let's go together.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:22.030
Sorry. I can't go with you.

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:26.200
But you got along with Haruto so well.

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:29.120
A man who forgot what it feels like to face things

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:31.660
doesn't deserve to be with you.

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:34.500
And... Haruto!

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:37.580
I don't plan on making friends with you.

00:21:37.880 --> 00:21:39.460
I'm going to settle this someday!

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:42.210
Don't go and die before I kill you!

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:43.970
Yeah. You too.

00:21:48.680 --> 00:21:51.470
Takanori, you're so stubborn!

00:21:51.640 --> 00:21:55.230
We were so close to reviving Subaru!

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:57.730
But we haven't gotten further away either.

00:21:58.020 --> 00:21:59.650
Thanks, Satsuki.

00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:01.070
We're friends.

00:22:01.270 --> 00:22:02.980
Of course I'd help you.

00:22:03.190 --> 00:22:05.740
And we're rivals, right?

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:07.490
I'm not going to lose.

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:09.910
What are you guys doing?

00:22:10.070 --> 00:22:11.490
-It's a secret!
-It's a secret!

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:13.240
What do you mean?

00:23:20.020 --> 00:23:21.940
They've gotten weaker.

00:23:22.110 --> 00:23:25.690
But Haruto is recalling how to fight,

00:23:25.860 --> 00:23:28.570
and Satsuki has awakened, just like we planned.

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:32.910
Ideally, I wish Takanori had awakened too.

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:37.160
It's not my job to do this kind of stuff.

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:39.910
I'm relying on you, Clive.

00:23:40.210 --> 00:23:41.370
Hey.

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:44.040
I changed my name so no one would find out.

00:23:44.250 --> 00:23:45.800
Call me by my new name.

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:48.090
You're right. Sorry.

00:23:48.380 --> 00:23:50.680
Let's do one more performance

00:23:51.130 --> 00:23:53.550
before the touching reunion.

00:23:56.100 --> 00:23:57.810
Hey, hey! Are you ready?

00:23:58.020 --> 00:24:00.350
-Ready for what?
-We're going to the ocean, right?

00:24:00.520 --> 00:24:02.270
Did you get a swimsuit and a float?

00:24:02.440 --> 00:24:04.270
We're not going there for fun.

00:24:04.440 --> 00:24:06.480
Episode 7, "Seeking the Sword."

00:24:06.650 --> 00:24:09.240
Well, I do have them ready.
